    "created_at": "2019-01-03T16:01:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-01-03T16:01:59Z",
    "body": "The other volume-related attribute, `muted`, reflects to `defaultMuted` rather than directly to `muted`. If we were to add a  `volume` Attribute, it should probably reflect to `defaultVolume`, and have that value affect `volume` only until that property is set directly.",
