    "created_at": "2019-01-07T19:00:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-01-07T19:00:49Z",
    "body": "The most straightforward spec fix would be to change the `muted` content property / `defaultMuted` IDL property to match the `checked` content property / `defaultChecked` IDL property in HTMLInputElement, in that you can freely change the content property up until the non-default IDL property has been set.  Then do the same for `volume` / `defaultVolume`.",
